# INTRO
introSlug: residential-driveways
intro:
  heading: "Expert Residential Asphalt Driveway Installation & Replacement"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      A residential asphalt driveway is one of the most prominent features of your home's exterior, delivering essential curb appeal, functional parking, and long-term property value. At S. Phaneuf & Associates, we bring over 35 years of civil paving experience to residential homeowners across Massachusetts, constructing smooth, durable driveways engineered to withstand heavy freeze-thaw cycles and seasonal weather shifts.
    - >
      The longevity of an asphalt driveway depends entirely on structural base preparation. We don't just lay asphalt over tired gravel; our crews excavate unsuitable native soil, install geotextile separation fabric when needed, grade for positive water runoff away from your foundation, and compact 6 to 10 inches of dense-graded processed stone base. We then apply commercial-grade Hot Mix Asphalt (HMA) compacted to maximum density with heavy vibratory rollers.
    - >
      Whether you need a brand-new driveway for custom home construction, a complete tear-out and replacement of a cracked, aging driveway, an expanded parking turnaround, or decorative enhancements like Cape Cod berms and granite cobblestone aprons, S. Phaneuf & Associates delivers turnkey craftsmanship with single-source accountability.

